 \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the cloud management feature benefit users?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Cloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty options are available with this media server?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard manufacturer warranty for the Colorlight Z6 Media Server, typically covering hardware defects and performance issues. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Colorlight Z6 compare to other media servers?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Z6 combines high-resolution 4K output with versatile network options and integrated cloud management, distinguishing it from alternatives that may lack remote management or multi-network connectivity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this device be used for digital advertising content scheduling?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. It is designed for content scheduling, playback, and LED display management, making it ideal for digital signage and advertising applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation of the Colorlight Z6 Media Server complex?\", \"ac