ver support?</h3><p>The Colorlight Z6 Media Server supports a 4K output resolution at 60Hz, ensuring crisp and smooth high-definition video playback for LED displays.</p><h3>How can I connect the media server to my network?</h3><p>This device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.</p><h3>Is there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?</h3><p>Yes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.</p><h3>How does the cloud management feature benefit users?</h3><p>Cloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Colorlight Z6 Media Server - LED Solutions Dubai & GCC | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Enhance LED display content with Colorlight Z6 Media Server. Available in Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for advanced LED tech!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[